<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever Q1 guilder net up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Unilever Q1 guilder net up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)			3.19   vs    2.87</p>
<p>    Net profit/current exchange rates	 898	vs  808</p>
<p>    Net profit/constant exchange rates	841	vs  825</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)			     20.92   vs   19.92</p>
<p>    Op profit before exceptionals (billion)   1.73   vs    1.50</p>
<p>    Op profit after exceptionals (billion)    1.53   vs    1.46</p>
<p>NOTES - Analysts had expected Anglo-Dutch food to detergents group Unilever NV/Plc to post a first quarter net profit of 885 to 958 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Income from fixed investments	  11	vs   21</p>
<p>    Interest charges			  134	vs  164</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit (billion)		1.41     vs  1.32</p>
<p>    Tax					   536	vs  459</p>
<p>    Minority interests			 33	vs   32</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
